mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the never-entered levels of Banban’s Kindergarten:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of Garten of Banban 4, you are forced to run away and delve even deeper into the mysterious establishment that is Banban’s kindergarten. You are heading down to where no human dares to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/eef9b3d8d33c3a083dc483c89654df0d.poster.avif?t=1750914490\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/eef9b3d8d33c3a083dc483c89654df0d.webm?t=1750914490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/eef9b3d8d33c3a083dc483c89654df0d.mp4?t=1750914490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/5426938602b9e093ffd132cf434a459c.poster.avif?t=1750914490\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/5426938602b9e093ffd132cf434a459c.webm?t=1750914490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499800/extras/5426938602b9e093ffd132cf434a459c.mp4?t=1750914490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No more friends to make…</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have run out of friends to make. From now on, you only meet new enemies who will make sure you never feel alone! In Banban’s Kindergarten, there are enemies to be made in every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"